      "role": "user",
      "content": "i cant even look at the news anymore. everything just feels so... pointless. like why even bother planning for a future or building anything when everything is just gonna collapse anyway? it feels like we're just watching a slow motion train wreck and there's nothing anyone can actually do to stop it.",
